  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EU Cultural Initiatives in Jordan 2023</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The overall objective of the project of which this service contract will be a part is as follows: To promote better knowledge of the EU culture and the overall EU cooperation priorities in Jordan, contribute to mutual understanding, dialogue between cultures and to bring the EU and Jordan societies&apos; closer together.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The specific objectives of this contract are as follows:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;1) to raise awareness of the EU and Member States&#xBF; culture and of the EU cooperation priorities, in general.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;2) to present the EU as active initiator and supporter of diverse cultural expressions.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;3) to express the EU support to Jordanian cultural operators and creative cultural industries in the country.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
